        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 4665dab1-e099-438b-8419-f80d3106ec33).Image",
        "Description": "Miami is cawing Agents.\rThe twin Flamingos, better known as &quot;The Avian Hue&quot; in underground circles, have hatched their swan song. The leaders of the gang, Blue-Footed Booby and Great Tit, have taken Lee codename Yellow-Bellied Sapsucker under their wings. Together with Dickcissel and the Rough-Faced Shag they plan to ruffle everyones feathers. A little bird told me the situation will get feathery after you&apos;re done, so steal a good ride before beeing led on a wild goose chase.\r\rBy Celllie",
